{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_14_level_main_14-14_end",
  "groupId": "main_14",
  "stageId": "main_14-14",
  "title": "抢占舷侧区域",
  "storyCode": "14-16",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-14_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d2068dcd3f19138610c3aa89808dcc2242837639f8e829f1a33b38a16b002b4e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1343_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你说你们不会抵抗——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1343_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们想用死来解脱——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1343_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "将死的刺客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她将匕首递进了刺客的胸膛，特意避开致命的要害。\n她想听到躲藏在面罩下的懦夫的哀嚎。\n她缓缓转动着匕首。哪怕只是一声怯懦的气音......\n她渴望听到。\n但什么也没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "将死的刺客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1343_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不会现在就死。这么简单就死......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1343_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们......带走了殿下——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1343_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "死，太轻易了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1343_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你说你们接下任务时已经不准备活着——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1343_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1343_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也想活对不对？你不想逃吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她想要他们逃，她渴望他们逃。\n这样她才能追逐，才能猎杀，才能让他们在无尽的绝望里死去。\n她要饮用他们的绝望。\n可这样也不够。远远不够。到底怎么样才够呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1343_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来，拿着这枚手雷。它马上就会爆炸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1343_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就蹲在这里，向我证明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1343_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也可以扔掉它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1343_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "扔掉它，你会活着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1343_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不杀你，我会放你走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "将死的刺客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1343_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1343_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "扔啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "将死的刺客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "将死的刺客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这东西爆炸应该会让我什么都不留下吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1343_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "将死的刺客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "将死的刺客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你该站远点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她不相信。她想要找到眼前之人假装的痕迹。\n只要他犹豫。只要他想要活下去——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "白光从她的面前绽放，爆炸的原点在那只紧紧攥着手雷的手里。\n火光从她的脸庞掠过，但她却感受不到丝毫的满足。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "远远不够......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "够了，W！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "他都化成灰了！",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不，还不够。\n远远不够。\n我还准备了更多东西——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "W！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......W。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "37_g9_airshipdockcorridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她看到了黑色的潮水在爆炸的余烬中翻涌，退去。\n那个人呢？已经完全找不到痕迹了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我是不是一次性把储备用得太多了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "管它呢，存着不用才是浪费。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你没事了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我......没事。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你刚才......怎么了？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没怎么啊，不是在救你吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（低沉的嘶鸣）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小怪物，你记得这些人吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些在过去就该全死掉的幽灵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（愤怒的高吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......过去就该死掉的人？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你认识这些......幽灵？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不认识吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我......应该认识吗？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你现在冷静得......有点让我害怕。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵。你最好不认识。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道这是死魂灵的什么把戏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还是在殿下所在的这艘船上——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但他死定了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "恐怕没有这么简单......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我预感，之后还会出现更多......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我求之不得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我现在对这次行动，越来越有兴趣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走吧。是这个方向吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "对，这边。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "不，那边。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你走前面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怕什么，这个小怪物会陪着你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "待在我的视野内，我才能随时反应。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......好吧。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和我合作也没有多么困难，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "37_g9_airshipdockcorridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "廊道上充斥着死亡的味道。死寂，让人恶心。\n不用别人的帮助，她也能确定，他们离死魂灵的核心越来越近。\n殿下怎么会愿意待在这种地方？\n殿下也会在那里吗？\n殿下，还记得我吗？\n她有很多的问题，但是想得越多，她反而越难以兴奋。\n不能让殿下看到她这样低沉的样子......\n殿下总是会笑着对她说，她多笑笑就好看多了。她记得很清楚——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我正想你们呢，混蛋们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞空艇的“幽灵”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到此为止。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞空艇的“幽灵”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到此为止......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞空艇的“幽灵”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前面不能通过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "{@nickname}，别停。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走廊的尽头一定就是我们要找的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你只需要抓牢小怪物，其他什么都不用管。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我保证，他们在碰到你之前就会全都变成灰烬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞空艇的“幽灵”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你一个人总有顾不上的时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（愤怒的嘶吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Mon3tr，我没事！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "W，再帮我拖延一些时间，我有办法能解决！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是小兔子！不用你告诉我怎么做！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要做什么就干脆点，别废话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......我相信你。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "好，我继续往前走。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞空艇的“幽灵”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们去处理博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你们不会真以为我会就这么扔着那个人不管吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞空艇的“幽灵”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和死魂灵那个发疯的老东西待久了让你们脑子也不好使了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可是提前给他留了一堆礼物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "眼睛闭紧了，{@nickname}——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“砰”！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "好痛......我就知道你没这么老实。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "果然你在我身上还留了“保险”......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还轮不到你夸我。本来想等和老女人会合时给她点惊喜，现在全浪费了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞空艇的“幽灵”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "注意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再多赏你们些好东西！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "犄角旮旯全给你们照亮了，你们会不会死得快点——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘁，没用吗？那只能用老办法，都再砍一遍了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（兴奋地附和）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你只管负责好那个人的小命就行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不满的低吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "幽灵从走廊尽头的黑暗中源源不断地涌出来，好似永远也杀不尽。\n一茬接一茬，无惧死亡。\n就像当年一样——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1343_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是谁在帮你们？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉默的刺客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1343_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她没有得到任何的回答。\n这条好像没有尽头的走廊明明躺满了凶手的尸体，她却为何拼凑不出关于这场背叛的完整答案？\n但她确定，真相就藏在这里。\n藏在巴别塔，藏在PRTS系统记录的每项不起眼的任务里。\n甚至就藏在......这条走廊的尽头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在这......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1343_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1343_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在这里......在这些尸体的下面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴别塔成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1308_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是回来增援的吗......去救殿下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1343_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1343_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你为什么在这......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴别塔成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1308_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想保护殿下，但是不知道被谁打晕了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴别塔成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1308_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们是不是救下殿下了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1343_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看到那些刺客了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴别塔成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1308_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本舰的防御突然失效，然后很多人突然涌了进来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴别塔成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1308_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们都想保护殿下，和我一起的兄弟们——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1343_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些是你的兄弟？他们死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1343_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你活着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴别塔成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1308_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1343_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "殿下死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴别塔成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1308_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1343_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵，保护殿下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1343_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拿着这个手雷，继续保护殿下吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她忍住了冲动。如果自己当时留在这里有多好。\n如果她留下了......结果会改变吗？\n她跨过尸体，沿着走廊继续走下去。\n而背后那声爆炸的轰鸣迟迟没有响起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1343_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "废物。懦夫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "当她浑身是血地走到议长室的门口时，刺客的尸体堆积在入口，她不想再向前。\n没有杀掉叛徒，她怎么配悼念殿下？\n主导这一切的人是谁，她心中早已推算出自己的答案。\n是那个人带着所有的刺客，站在这里，将死亡引向殿下。\n杀掉所有参与这场恶行的人后，她将向那个人讨一个答案。\n那会是她最后一个目标......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "W，该走了！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "门开了，现在进舱室！",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "37_g9_airshipdockcorridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她看着你。\n你站在走廊尽头的黑暗里。\nMon3tr庞大的身躯挡住了所有扑向你的幽灵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我把他们全都引出来了！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Mon3tr撑不了太久！",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（高昂的咆哮）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小怪物，给我忍住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她朝着黑色幽灵聚集的地方抛出了数枚炸弹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（愤怒的嘶吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "W毫不犹豫地一头扎进了爆炸的气浪之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她穿过敌人和Mon3tr，穿越了火光，空气的爆鸣不断在耳边炸开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "50_g10_airshipwitchcraftcore"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "W来到了门的另一侧。\n她回头望去——\n仍然站在走廊上的那个人，正将手按在舱门控制器上，背后似乎有无数的幽灵试图涌出。\n在她的记忆里，这个场面从未存在过。\n但对那场她猜测过无数次的刺杀，有一个可能的画面在她的脑海中永远挥之不去——\n那位“恶灵”是否也曾如此站在殿下的面前？\n那位“恶灵”的身后是否也曾涌出无数夺走殿下生命的罪人？\n那位“恶灵”是否就是最后打开议长室那扇门的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Mon3tr，撤回来！我要关门了！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（兴奋的嘶吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "W，补一枚炸弹拖延！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她没有反驳，下意识地扔出了随身的爆炸物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "50_g10_airshipwitchcraftcore"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（兴奋地举起你）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "疼疼疼！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我的背才刚受了伤！",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她看着你，仿佛正试图从你身上找到过去熟悉之人的影子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......为什么用......这种眼神看着我？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样就能确保他们没法进来？这么简单......就是你天才的计划？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "简单......吗？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "简单的办法也总是很有效嘛。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，那是......结晶化？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "看来你发现了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我刚进入这里时就发现了飞空艇正在结晶化。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，刚才就是那扇门彻底结晶化前，我们最后的机会了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你一开始就做好了独自堵门的准备？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "不是还有Mon3tr和你吗？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我相信你和Mon3tr。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "相信......我？呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在那件事弄清楚之前，我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "看，这里......应该就是我们要找的地方了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我的计算结果果然没错。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "舱室深处，引擎在咆哮。\n灵魂在燃烧，焚尽后喷发而出的，是痛苦和愤怒。\n飞空艇的核心展露在了你们的面前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "飞空艇的引擎......是靠燃烧死魂灵？！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(殿下......不在这。)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "管它是什么，反正炸掉总能瘫痪这艘破船吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赶紧把这边的事结束，我还有更重要的事要做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要和我去见殿下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......好，我答应你。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，老东西，我知道你在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我亲自把给你准备的特制礼品放你床下面了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "准备收礼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "不对劲......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "炸弹没有起作用？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "燃烧的核心于瞬间停滞，四散的火焰陡然开始倒灌回核心之中。\n点燃生命的火光逐渐微弱下去。\n噪音皆消失，只剩下足以听到心脏跳动的宁静。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "偌大的舱室被黑暗缓缓地笼罩。\n阴影自核心处流淌而下，汇聚成河流，而后愈来愈急......\n直至足以吞噬整个舱室的黑色浪潮扑向了你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "37_g9_airshipdockcorridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如此强烈的痛苦和愤怒......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船舱中的影子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "异族的魔王，我不会再为你而多费口舌！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船舱中的影子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为特蕾西娅，我已经容忍了你们一次又一次冒犯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船舱中的影子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们可知，你们试图阻止的到底是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船舱中的影子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萨卡兹需要的不止这场战争！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船舱中的影子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们想掐灭的，是足以扭转我们命运的火焰！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船舱中的影子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们无法得逞——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "淹没阿米娅的黑色潮水在退去，阴影中拉扯她的力量也在逐渐减弱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他在收缩自己的力量？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所有的阴影......都消散了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看来其他人先找到了死魂灵盘踞的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士还好吗？不知道凯尔希医生和W小姐现在在哪......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我能感受到愤怒情绪最激烈的地点，那里应该就是我们要找的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，凯尔希医生，坚持住......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我会去找你们的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "37_g9_airshipdockcorridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "这些爆炸的痕迹......\nW小姐一定来过这里！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是......Mon3tr的爪痕？！难道博士和W小姐在一起——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "自走廊尽头的阴影中，走出了阿米娅从未想过会在此遇到的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿米娅一直未曾忘记多年前的那场噩梦。\n她记得特蕾西娅，记得那柄插入自己胸膛的黑色长剑......\n记得那些黑色长袍的凶手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "37_g9_airshipdockcorridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不可能......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们......应该都死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿斯卡纶小姐明明确认过......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞空艇的“幽灵”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......“魔王”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞空艇的“幽灵”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你晚了一步，她知道你会来此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特蕾西娅小姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞空艇的“幽灵”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米娅，你所寻找的人，他们必死无疑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞空艇的“幽灵”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "省下你读取情绪的功夫吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞空艇的“幽灵”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "止步于此......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞空艇的“幽灵”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或是跨过我们的尸体。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看到了你们脑海中破碎的画面——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么会......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们来自巴别塔？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
